 ("It's your birthday and nobody planned anything. You", ['Say "it\'s fine!" fourteen times.', 'Wait by the phone, eat cake alone, and post a sad story.', "Cancel everyone else's plans out of principle.", 'Plan your own party, invite the right six, and hand out hats.'], ['Fourteen fines and not one slice of cake.', 'A sad story is a reminder. Your friends felt guilty and forgot by lunch.', 'You ruined their evening to make a point. The point is you have no party.', 'A hostess in your own life. Hats for everyone.'], "Waiting is a vote for other people's calendars. A party you plan yourself has the right guests and the right hats. Six guests who showed up on purpose beat sixty who were told to."),
